# Changelog

- Unreleased
  * Add Phase-2 hardware performance-counter meters on Linux:
    'Censor.withCounter' acquires an 'instructions_retired' or
    'branches_retired' meter via perf_event_open (user-space only, so
    usable unprivileged at perf_event_paranoid <= 2). The counter is
    deterministic and thread-affine; the callback runs on one OS thread
    and the fd is released on exit. wallClock is unchanged.

- 0.1.0 (2026-05-31)
  * Initial release. Sequential constant-time testing via
    anytime-valid e-processes, with wall-clock measurement on macOS
    and Linux.
